node.doctext:
In addition to your error pointed out by [pryrt], I would suggest that it probably does not make very much sense to have a shebang line with Windows. Except, of course, that it enables you to use the <c>-w</c> flag. But it is probably better to use the <c>use warnings</c> pragma and to start your program with:
<c>
use strict;
use warnings;
</c>
